#: ../../source/workflows/manage-iterations.md:1
#: 7a93b56392174356b011db7d92f2162d
msgid "组织多轮数据和模型版本"
msgstr "Organize multiple data and model iterations"

#: ../../source/workflows/manage-iterations.md:3
#: e145d669b30f46728a3e58281e834f4e
#
msgid ""
"当同一体系已经经历多轮候选生成、DFT 和训练后，最容易丢失的不是文件，而是“这一轮为什么存在”。 这条流程把中间数据文件和 `数据管理` "
"记录结合起来，保证后续能回到来源。"
msgstr ""
"After a system goes through repeated candidate generation, DFT, and "
"training, the easiest thing to lose is not a file but the reason that a "
"round existed. This workflow combines intermediate files with `Data "
"Management` records so every result can be traced back to its source."

#: ../../source/workflows/manage-iterations.md:6
#: 3cd173a3939a44a582bfad2a7f066b23
msgid "每轮保留四个边界"
msgstr "Keep four boundaries for each round"

#: ../../source/workflows/manage-iterations.md:8
#: 8278e51d8c484960b58f283ff9b465e6
msgid "建议每轮至少区分："
msgstr "At minimum, distinguish these stages in every round:"

#: ../../source/workflows/manage-iterations.md:10
#: 19cd281609cf4aa4bf9888d39528819f
msgid ""
"candidate_pool.xyz\n"
"candidate_pool_clean.xyz\n"
"dft_labeled.xyz\n"
"train.xyz\n"
msgstr ""
"candidate_pool.xyz\n"
"candidate_pool_clean.xyz\n"
"dft_labeled.xyz\n"
"train.xyz\n"

#: ../../source/workflows/manage-iterations.md:17
#: e3ac4d168e424ef19e7686a889077756
msgid "`candidate_pool.xyz`：生成卡片的原始输出，可能包含异常结构。"
msgstr ""
"`candidate_pool.xyz`: raw output from generation cards; it may still "
"contain anomalous structures."

#: ../../source/workflows/manage-iterations.md:18
#: 5b084b81838d4b63aa6026f990cb4a8c
msgid "`candidate_pool_clean.xyz`：完成几何和预测预筛后的候选池。"
msgstr ""
"`candidate_pool_clean.xyz`: the candidate pool after geometry and "
"prediction-based pre-screening."

#: ../../source/workflows/manage-iterations.md:19
#: f8d92a86dd0e41c68870ac9f9e08ff3c
msgid "`dft_labeled.xyz`：已经得到 DFT 标签的结构。"
msgstr "`dft_labeled.xyz`: structures that already have DFT labels."

#: ../../source/workflows/manage-iterations.md:20
#: f475b0ea281c4469b1284d71f7761285
msgid "`train.xyz`：真正进入本轮训练的数据，可能还包含历史数据。"
msgstr ""
"`train.xyz`: data actually used in this training iteration; it may also "
"include historical data."

#: ../../source/workflows/manage-iterations.md:22
#: 11536e9dd3d44bf4a42859acc0329045
msgid "不要用同一个文件名反复覆盖四个阶段。否则发现问题时无法判断是生成、清洗、DFT 还是合并阶段引入。"
msgstr ""
"Do not repeatedly overwrite all four stages with one filename. Otherwise "
"you cannot tell whether a problem was introduced during generation, "
"cleaning, DFT, or merging."

#: ../../source/workflows/manage-iterations.md:24
#: a11e08da07244f75913e4f1018ae965f
msgid "在 Data Management 中记录什么"
msgstr "What to record in Data Management"

#: ../../source/workflows/manage-iterations.md:26
#: 99709f48876641c2acb41d5302a9a67a
msgid "以材料体系或研究目标建立 `Project`，每次正式训练建立一个 `Model(version)`。每个版本至少记录："
msgstr ""
"Create a `Project` for a material system or research goal, and a "
"`Model(version)` for each formal training run. Each version should record"
" at least:"

#: ../../source/workflows/manage-iterations.md:28
#: 9c22b0fe40254d2697ff486b843bbdf5
msgid "模型和训练结果目录；"
msgstr "The model and training-result directories;"

#: ../../source/workflows/manage-iterations.md:29
#: 0660edad327345d89cb47cd6482a2a07
msgid "本轮训练集路径；"
msgstr "The training-set path for this round;"

#: ../../source/workflows/manage-iterations.md:30
#: ae258f16b6754a16b27cc9658abd905c
msgid "新增结构的来源和数量；"
msgstr "The source and count of newly added structures;"

#: ../../source/workflows/manage-iterations.md:31
#: 8e8acb9adb964e30aebc14a50edaa64b
msgid "删除或隔离了哪些异常结构；"
msgstr "Which anomalous structures were removed or isolated;"

#: ../../source/workflows/manage-iterations.md:32
#: 8a73ac4d6ce44e4dae44253633c570db
msgid "本轮主要目标，例如 `surface`、`vacancy`、`magnetic` 或 `high-force`；"
msgstr ""
"The main goal of the round, such as `surface`, `vacancy`, `magnetic`, or "
"`high-force`;"

#: ../../source/workflows/manage-iterations.md:33
#: 69e89872b9954ea1b7d8bacd92acc58c
msgid "当前已知限制。"
msgstr "Known limitations at this point."

#: ../../source/workflows/manage-iterations.md:35
#: a447653f80b148ae933e3079bef51ac9
msgid "建议使用连续版本名，例如 `v001`、`v002`，不要把“final”“final2”“new-final”当成版本关系。"
msgstr ""
"Use consecutive version names such as `v001` and `v002`; do not use "
"“final”, “final2”, or “new-final” as version relationships."

#: ../../source/workflows/manage-iterations.md:37
#: 2a7f2445fda24c4d86286641624a6640
msgid "一轮结束时的检查"
msgstr "End-of-round review"

#: ../../source/workflows/manage-iterations.md:39
#: b79f25dd25204566a8ab8ccfbbd832ff
msgid "完成训练和误差复核后，再写版本记录。记录应能回答："
msgstr ""
"Write the version record after training and error review. It should "
"answer:"

#: ../../source/workflows/manage-iterations.md:41
#: 90d8af4cbee8452fb6b04a4b213fcbda
msgid "这一轮相对上一轮增加了什么；"
msgstr "What this round added relative to the previous one;"

#: ../../source/workflows/manage-iterations.md:42
#: 814f83bcaee941e59bfb50a93a43f20d
msgid "哪些判断来自 DFT，哪些只来自 NEP 预测预筛；"
msgstr ""
"Which conclusions came from DFT and which came only from NEP pre-"
"screening;"

#: ../../source/workflows/manage-iterations.md:43
#: 28212d875f0d4928a4e91f5447bbf670
msgid "模型在哪些结构范围内做过检查；"
msgstr "Which structural ranges were checked for the model;"

#: ../../source/workflows/manage-iterations.md:44
#: fd1a01b66bb34add8b3acf81658cf5b6
msgid "下一轮最明确的数据缺口是什么。"
msgstr "What the clearest data gap for the next round is."

#: ../../source/workflows/manage-iterations.md:46
#: a48a211904574c4b97778883be029a56
#
msgid "`数据管理` 只保存项目、路径、标签和备注，不会复制大体积训练数据。移动目录后必须更新记录， 也不能把数据库记录当成数据备份。"
msgstr ""
"`Data Management` stores only projects, paths, labels, and notes; it does"
" not copy large training datasets. Update records after moving "
"directories, and do not treat database entries as data backups."
